#b#cff0099ff* How to join#nb#nc
 - Every day at 17:30 and 23:30 (Philippine time, GMT+8).
 - Registration opens 5 minutes before: Amos > TDM Arena > Register.
 - Entry fee: 10,000,000 Penya (refunded if the TDM is cancelled). Level 60 or higher.
 - Changed your mind? While registration is open, press Cancel in the TDM Arena window: you get the fee back minus 20%.
 - When the arena opens, press Join within 1 minute to go to the waiting area (the Arena Manager's platform).
 - Fewer than 2 players inside = the TDM is cancelled and every fee is refunded.
#b#cff0099ff* Teams#nb#nc
 - When the battle starts, everyone inside is split into Red and Blue, balanced by level.
 - Team mates show their name in the team color; enemies show "Enemy".
 - You can't hurt your team mates. Buffs and heals only work on your own team.
 - A player who joins late goes to the smaller team.
#b#cff0099ff* Battle#nb#nc
 - The battle lasts 10 minutes. Every player has 10 lives.
 - After a death: 10 seconds in the waiting area, then back on your team's side.
 - Every kill is 1 point for your team. Most points wins; equal points = a draw.
 - No lives left: you watch from the waiting area until the end.
 - The battle ends early when a team has no lives left, or nobody of a team is in the arena for 1 minute.
 - No EXP loss and no PK penalty in the arena.
#b#cff0099ff* Staying away#nb#nc
 - Offline or outside the arena while the battle runs, you lose 1 life every minute, and the other team gets 1 point.
#b#cff0099ff* Rewards (PVP Tokens)#nb#nc
 - 1 PVP Token for every kill, paid at once.
 - Winning team: +15 for every player with at least 1 kill (a draw pays no team bonus).
 - MVP (most kills): +20.
 - Spend your tokens at Amos or Donaris.
